<title>ISRAEL: One killed, 10 wounded in Hebron - security chief.</title>
<headline>One killed, 10 wounded in Hebron - security chief.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Israeli soldier shot dead a Palestinian and wounded 10 in the West Bank town of Hebron on Wednesday, the chief of Palestinian security in the West Bank said.</p>
<p>&quot;One was killed and 10 were wounded,&quot; said Jibril Rajoub in an interview with Israeli army radio.</p>
